As a result of the discussion the following was done: Tdoc R3-201826 was revised in R3-202769. R3-202769 was built from the merge of R3-201826, R3-202074 and R3-202161 as follows: Section 2 added, parts of sections 10.7.1 and 10.9.1 removed from R3-202161 but rebased on TS 37.340 g.1.0 Introduction of section 10.X copied from the removed 10.7.1 and 10.9.1 Section 10.X.1 taken from R3-201826 for the 4g to 5g case Section 10.X.2 taken from R3-202074 for the 5g to 4g case Moderator’s summary: It is proposed to agree R3-202769. Tdoc R3-201825 proposed a CR to TS 38.300. Some companies think that is not needed. Some companies think that at minimum some references should be done towards TS 37.340. Moderator’s summary: It is proposed to check till next meeting if CR to 38.300 is needed. The following is proposed: Proposal 1: It is proposed to agree R3-202769. Proposal 2: Check whether changes to TS 38.300 are needed till next RAN3.

